  "body": "I implemented https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/3484 with the assumption that it would cause invited users to trigger a /device_list update via /sync (as joined users do).\r\n\r\nIn practice it doesn't work (but clients are okay anyway as they query the device list via /unstable/keys/query whenever the membership list changes anyway).",
